# The EPUB build regenerates everything below from the print sources in ../ .
# Track only the toolchain sources and the final deliverable; ignore the rest
# (per-chapter *-body.tex, ~200 math/figure SVGs, XHTML, and tex4ht intermediates).
*

# Toolchain sources
!.gitignore
!README.md
!build-book.sh
!mkbody.pl
!renderfigs.sh
!svg2png.py
!fixepub.py
!ebook-preamble.tex
!ebook.cfg
!book-ebook.tex
!friends.css

# Final deliverable
!book-ebook.epub
